{"seq":3,"slug":"simulation-timing","title":"仿真与时序","url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/verilog-hdl/verification/simulation-timing","wordCount":1106,"readingTime":5,"html":"<h1 id=\"仿真与时序\">仿真与时序</h1><p><a href=\"../modeling/blocking-nonblocking\">阻塞与非阻塞赋值</a>那一篇留了个尾巴：为什么 <code>&lt;=</code> 要「到时间步末才写」？为什么有时同样的代码换个写法仿真结果就变了？答案都藏在仿真器的引擎室里——一套叫「事件驱动调度」的机制。理解它，你对 Verilog 时序行为的认识就会从「背规则」升级为「知其所以然」。这一篇打开这台引擎，看清仿真时间是怎么推进的、事件是怎么排队的、竞争冒险又是从哪冒出来的。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>Verilog 仿真不是逐行执行程序，而是<strong>事件驱动</strong>的：仿真器维护一个按时间排序的事件队列，反复取出当前时间点的所有事件处理，处理过程中可能生成新事件（同一时刻或未来时刻），处理完就把仿真时间推进到下一个有事件的时刻。信号在两个事件之间保持不变。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;    A[取出当前时间点的事件] --&gt; B[处理事件&lt;br/&gt;更新信号值]&#10;    B --&gt; C{产生了新事件?}&#10;    C --&gt;|本时刻| A&#10;    C --&gt;|未来时刻| D[插入事件队列]&#10;    D --&gt; E{当前时刻还有事件?}&#10;    E --&gt;|是| A&#10;    E --&gt;|否| F[推进时间到下个事件点]&#10;    F --&gt; A\">flowchart TD\n    A[取出当前时间点的事件] --&gt; B[处理事件&lt;br/&gt;更新信号值]\n    B --&gt; C{产生了新事件?}\n    C --&gt;|本时刻| A\n    C --&gt;|未来时刻| D[插入事件队列]\n    D --&gt; E{当前时刻还有事件?}\n    E --&gt;|是| A\n    E --&gt;|否| F[推进时间到下个事件点]\n    F --&gt; A</pre><p>关键在于：同一个仿真时间点内，可能要处理很多轮事件。Verilog 用「分层事件队列」把这些事件分成若干区域，规定它们的处理顺序，下表是简化版。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>区域</th>\n<th>处理内容</th>\n<th>何时执行</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>Active</td>\n<td>阻塞赋值、<code>assign</code>、算非阻塞右值、<code>$display</code></td>\n<td>最先</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Inactive</td>\n<td><code>#0</code> 延时事件</td>\n<td>Active 清空后</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>NBA</td>\n<td>非阻塞赋值的左值写入</td>\n<td>Inactive 后</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Postponed</td>\n<td><code>$strobe</code>、<code>$monitor</code>、断言采样</td>\n<td>同一时刻最后</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"为什么非阻塞用旧值\">为什么非阻塞用旧值</h2><p>有了分层队列，<a href=\"../modeling/blocking-nonblocking\">阻塞与非阻塞赋值</a>的谜题迎刃而解。在一个时钟沿，所有时序块同时进入 Active 区域，它们把各自非阻塞赋值的<strong>右值</strong>算好（用的是此刻还没被更新的旧值），暂存起来；直到 Active 区域全部清空、进入 NBA 区域，这些右值才被真正写入左值。于是「所有触发器同时采样旧值」这一硬件事实被精确模拟。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"verilog\" data-code=\"// 时钟沿到来时：&#10;always @(posedge clk) a &lt;= b;   // 右值 b 在 Active 算好暂存&#10;always @(posedge clk) b &lt;= a;   // 右值 a（旧值）在 Active 算好暂存&#10;// NBA 区域：a、b 同时写入 → 实现交换，正是硬件行为\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>// 时钟沿到来时：</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>always @(posedge clk) a &#x3C;= b;   // 右值 b 在 Active 算好暂存</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>always @(posedge clk) b &#x3C;= a;   // 右值 a（旧值）在 Active 算好暂存</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// NBA 区域：a、b 同时写入 → 实现交换，正是硬件行为</span></span></code></pre></div><p>如果改用阻塞赋值，<code>a=b</code> 立即让 a 等于 b，第二句 <code>b=a</code> 就拿到了已更新的 a，交换失败——这就是竞争的根源。</p>\n<h2 id=\"竞争冒险\">竞争冒险</h2><p>当两个进程在同一时间点读写同一信号、而它们的相对顺序未被语言定义时，就出现<strong>竞争冒险</strong>（race condition）：仿真结果取决于仿真器的内部调度，可能换个工具就变。最经典的例子是一个块写信号、另一个块在同一沿读它。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"verilog\" data-code=\"// 危险：两个块在同一时钟沿对 q 一读一写，顺序未定义&#10;always @(posedge clk) q  = d;      // 用阻塞 → 竞争&#10;always @(posedge clk) y  = q;      // y 读到新 q 还是旧 q?\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>// 危险：两个块在同一时钟沿对 q 一读一写，顺序未定义</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>always @(posedge clk) q  = d;      // 用阻塞 → 竞争</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>always @(posedge clk) y  = q;      // y 读到新 q 还是旧 q?</span></span></code></pre></div><p>避免竞争的根本办法，正是<a href=\"../modeling/sequential-logic\">时序逻辑</a>反复强调的纪律：时序块一律用非阻塞赋值，让所有写入都推迟到 NBA 区域统一发生，读取则在 Active 区域看到稳定的旧值。</p>\n<h2 id=\"延时模型与时序检查\">延时模型与时序检查</h2><p><code>#</code> 延时在设计代码里不可综合，但在仿真和时序建模里很重要。门级仿真（综合后的网表仿真）会用标准延时格式 SDF 反标真实延时，并用 <code>$setup</code>、<code>$hold</code> 等系统任务检查触发器的建立/保持时间是否被违反。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>时序概念</th>\n<th>含义</th>\n<th>仿真中如何体现</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>建立时间 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>t</mi><mrow><mi>s</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>u</mi><mi>p</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">t_{setup}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9012em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">se</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">u</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">p</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>数据须在时钟沿前稳定的最小时长</td>\n<td><code>$setup</code> 检查，违反则报</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>保持时间 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>t</mi><mrow><mi>h</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>l</mi><mi>d</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">t_{hold}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7651em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">h</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">o</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">d</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>数据须在时钟沿后保持的最小时长</td>\n<td><code>$hold</code> 检查</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>传播延时 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>t</mi><mrow><mi>c</mi><mi>q</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">t_{cq}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9012em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">c</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">q</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>时钟沿到输出稳定的延时</td>\n<td>门级模型/SDF 反标</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>这些时序量满足的核心约束 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>T</mi><mrow><mi>c</mi><mi>l</mi><mi>k</mi></mrow></msub><mo>≥</mo><msub><mi>t</mi><mrow><mi>c</mi><mi>q</mi></mrow></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>t</mi><mrow><mi>l</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>g</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>c</mi></mrow></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>t</mi><mrow><mi>s</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>u</mi><mi>p</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">T_{clk} \\ge t_{cq} + t_{logic} + t_{setup}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">c</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≥</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9012em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">c</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">q</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9012em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">o</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">g</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">c</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9012em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">se</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">u</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">p</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>，在<a href=\"../foundations/rtl-abstraction\">RTL 抽象层次</a>里已作为最高频率的来源出现过。功能仿真验证「逻辑对不对」，门级时序仿真验证「在真实延时下还对不对」，二者是流片前的两道不同关卡，后者属于<a href=\"../practice/synthesis\">综合</a>之后的工作。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>Verilog 仿真是事件驱动的：维护时间排序的事件队列，处理完当前时刻所有事件再推进时间。</li>\n<li>同一时间点内用分层事件队列（Active/Inactive/NBA/Postponed）规定处理顺序，这是理解时序的钥匙。</li>\n<li>非阻塞赋值的右值在 Active 区域用旧值算好、左值在 NBA 区域才写入，从而精确模拟触发器同时采样。</li>\n<li>竞争冒险源于多进程在同一时刻读写同一信号且顺序未定义；时序块一律用非阻塞可根除。</li>\n<li><code>#</code> 延时与 <code>$setup</code>/<code>$hold</code> 检查服务于门级时序仿真，验证真实延时下设计是否仍正确。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"仿真与时序","id":"仿真与时序"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"为什么非阻塞用旧值","id":"为什么非阻塞用旧值"},{"level":2,"text":"竞争冒险","id":"竞争冒险"},{"level":2,"text":"延时模型与时序检查","id":"延时模型与时序检查"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"SystemVerilog 断言","url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/verilog-hdl/verification/systemverilog-assertions"},"next":{"title":"综合","url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/verilog-hdl/practice/synthesis"}}